{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24840","headline":"将之荆州南与张伯刚马惣锺陵夜别 · 杨衡","name":"将之荆州南与张伯刚马惣锺陵夜别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"荆台别路长，密绪分离状。\n莫诉杯来促，更筹屡已倡。\n烛花侵雾暗，瑟调寒风亮。\n谁念晓帆开，默睇参差浪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24840.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24840","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}